Package: diting-firmware-setup
Architecture: arm64
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, device-xiaomi-diting (>= 0.7.9),
 python3, m4, alsa-utils, erofs-utils, dmsetup, util-linux, apt,
 linux-firmware-qualcomm-graphics, linux-firmware-qualcomm-wireless
Description: extract the Xiaomi 12T Pro (diting) firmware from its own partitions
 The DSP, modem, GPU zap shader, video, Bluetooth and speaker amplifier
 firmware of the Xiaomi 12T Pro is signed for the device and cannot be
 redistributed. At first boot this reads it read-only from the phone's own
 Android partitions (modem, bluetooth, dsp, persist and vendor inside
 super), builds the firmware-xiaomi-diting package locally (including the
 voice call topology from the phone's ACDB and the camera register tables)
 and installs it.
